\"> dpCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(values, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, halfEps);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> noisyCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> noisySum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> noisyCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>高斯机制</strong>适用于 (ε,δ)-差分隐私设置，它使用高斯噪声替代拉普拉斯噪声。在多维查询和深度学习训练中，高斯机制通常比拉普拉斯机制更实用，因为高斯噪声在高维空间中的性质更好。</p>\n<p><strong>指数机制</strong>适用于非数值查询（如选择最优类别），它不是直接在输出上加噪，而是根据每个候选输出的&quot;质量分数&quot;按概率选择输出，质量分数越高的候选输出被选中的概率越大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隐私预算管理\">隐私预算管理</h2><p>隐私预算管理是差分隐私实践中最关键的工程挑战。组合定理（Composition Theorem）告诉我们，对同一数据集进行多次差分隐私查询时，总隐私损失会累积。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PrivacyBudget {&#10;  totalEpsilon: number;&#10;  totalDelta: number;&#10;  consumed: Array&lt;{&#10;    queryId: string;&#10;    epsilon: number;&#10;    delta: number;&#10;    timestamp: Date;&#10;  }&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;class PrivacyAccountant {&#10;  private budget: PrivacyBudget;&#10;&#10;  constructor(totalEpsilon: number, totalDelta: number) {&#10;    this.budget = {&#10;      totalEpsilon: totalEpsilon,&#10;      totalDelta: totalDelta,&#10;      consumed: [],&#10;    };&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  remaining(): { epsilon: number; delta: number } {&#10;    const usedEpsilon = this.budget.consumed.reduce((sum, q) =&gt; sum + q.epsilon, 0);&#10;    const usedDelta = this.budget.consumed.reduce((sum, q) =&gt; sum + q.delta, 0);&#10;    return {&#10;      epsilon: this.budget.totalEpsilon - usedEpsilon,&#10;      delta: this.budget.totalDelta - usedDelta,&#10;    };&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  canSpend(epsilon: number, delta: number = 0): boolean {&#10;    const rem = this.remaining();&#10;    return rem.epsilon &gt;= epsilon &amp;&amp; rem.delta &gt;= delta;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  spend(queryId: string, epsilon: number, delta: number = 0): boolean {&#10;    if (!this.canSpend(epsilon, delta)) return false;&#10;    this.budget.consumed.push({&#10;      queryId,&#10;      epsilon,&#10;      delta,&#10;      timestamp: new Date(),&#10;    });&#10;    return true;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PrivacyBudget</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  totalEpsilon</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  totalDelta</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  consumed</span><span style=\"color:#